#!args --crash-report apps/PaintCraft/tests/fixtures/crash_sample.txt
# crash_report.uis -- the window "PaintCraft Absturz" (crash.s, report mode: PaintCraft started by
# its crash handler with --crash-report FILE): message, protocol path, Details anzeigen /
# ausblenden (the protocol in a read-only text box), In die Zwischenablage kopieren,
# Ordner der Absturzberichte öffnen, PaintCraft neu starten, Beenden (headless runs only record the
# last three: probe #6720 value CRF_* = 1 restart, 2 quit, 4 copied, 8 folder).  No other module
# runs (no image, no menus).  The crash itself: tools/pn_crash_check.py.
size 680 520
theme light
expect text:"PaintCraft wurde unerwartet beendet" exists
expect #6720 text "apps/PaintCraft/tests/fixtures/crash_sample.txt"
expect #6720 value 0
expect #9901 missing
expect #6706 missing
click #6701
expect #6706 exists
expect button:"Details ausblenden" exists
shot build/tests/crash_report.png
click #6702
clip expect text
expect #6720 value 4
click #6703
expect #6720 value 12
click #6704
expect #6720 value 13
click #6705
expect #6720 value 15
click #6701
expect #6706 missing
theme dark
shot build/tests/crash_report_dark.png
